          "benefits_md": "> **Beneficiary-based subsidy:**\n\n\n- 50% for other categories.\n- 70% for Most Backward Castes, Scheduled Castes, and Scheduled Tribes.\n- 40% Entrepreneur-based subsidy.\n\n",
          "briefDescription": "The \"Mukhyamantri Samekit Chaur Vikas Yojana\" under Seven Nishchay-2, aims to develop undeveloped and unutilized private land in Bihar for fish-based integrated aquaculture. With a budget of ₹2972.79 lakh, the scheme targets the sustainable development of 600 hectares of Chaur land, enhancing fish.",
          "detailedDescription": [
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "The \"Mukhyamantri Samekit Chaur Vikas Yojana\" was launched by the Animal and Fisheries Resources Department, Government of Bihar. under Seven Nishchay-2, aims to develop undeveloped and unutilized private land in Bihar for fish-based integrated aquaculture. With a budget of ₹2972.79 lakh, the scheme targets the sustainable development of 600 hectares of Chaur land"
                }
              ],
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": ""
                }
              ],
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "bold": true,
                  "italic": true,
                  "text": "Objective:",
                  "underline": true
                }
              ],
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "Utilization of unutilized private land for fish farming."
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "list_item"
                },
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "Increase in fish production and productivity."
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "list_item"
                },
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "Groundwater level improvement, supporting the \"Jal-Jeevan-Hariyali\" campaign."
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "list_item"
                },
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "Additional employment opportunities for farmers."
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "list_item"
                },
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "Strengthening of the local economy."
                    }
                  ],
